    "detailed_description": "\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131080/extras/f15b93e33c0875de9af45fce59c5ce1a.webp?t=1690900784\" /></div>\u00a0  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131080/extras/8ca9a8b9cbb18f91ecc84d199cfc02bf.webp?t=1690900784\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131080/extras/1f037dcd25b6d510771b2baa274c81b7.webp?t=1690900784\" /></div>  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131080/extras/c6f55efcd1bd77a73a633ca22807b955.webp?t=1690900784\" /></div><br><br>Help Floppy Disks to repair from the flames a broken cell phone due to a strange malfunction on a World scale!<br><br>A factory malfunction is sabotaging equipment all over the world,<br>Help Floppy Disks in his battle to repair a broken cell phone from the flames before it explodes!<br><br>If you run to win, you will help find a solution to this global threat.<br>Going from one side to another, avoiding difficulties, you reach the goals, advancing levels, repairing areas in the cell phone's platelets and chips.<br><br>\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164\u3164<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131080/extras/55849883b5c6db0c3b526c11ab24ab5a.avif?t=1690900784\" /></div><br><br>A game for the whole family<br><br>*A runner with platform elements where Floppy Disks traverse the screen jumping platforms on their way to their target.<br><br>*Reach the finish line with the most Floppy Disks before the meter reaches zero and the phone doesn't explode.",
